  "EOF String Exists Because A Blank Last Number Causes Deserialization Death": "",
  "You're trying to load a savegame from version ": "你正在尝试加载来自版本 ",
  ", which is from before a MAJOR overhaul and improvement of our savegame format.  Deepest apologies for breaking saves from prior to v3.700, but doing so has allowed us to improve performance and reduce bugs. as well as make future bugs less likely.  \n\nThere is a beta branch on Steam for v3.309 (called <b><u>y_historical_3_309</u> - Release 3.309. Last version before the Great Refactor.</b>), which is the last stable-branch version prior to the changeover.  If you have a save from that time or before, please finish it on that branch before returning here to start new games.": "，它来自我们对存档格式进行重大重构与改进之前的版本。对于 v3.700 之前的存档因此失效，我们深表歉意，但这一改动使我们能够提升性能、减少错误，并降低未来出错的可能性。  \n\nSteam 上有一个 v3.309 的测试分支（名为 <b><u>y_historical_3_309</u> - 3.309 版本发布，大重构前的最后一个版本。</b>），这是变更前最后一个稳定分支版本。如果你拥有那个时期或更早的存档，请先在该分支上完成游戏，然后再回到这里开始新游戏。",
  "Savegames from ": "来自 的存档",
