  ".aiwprof": "",
  "Could not save your profile!  Your operating system told us access was denied.  This may be a temporary condition that will resolve itself in a few minutes.\n": "",
  "Could not find the profile '{0}'": "",
  "You're trying to load a profile that is an empty file!": "你正在尝试加载一个空文件作为档案！",
  "Error deserializing player profile data via xml: \n": "",
  "Could Not Load Prior Profile": "无法加载之前的档案",
  "The player profile data you had previously could not be loaded.  We changed formats on that in March of 2020, and that's probably all it is.  Apologies for the inconvenience!  It just had your chosen display name and default player color.\n\nThe game will now ask you to fill in those again, and you should be good to go indefinitely after that.": "你之前保存的玩家档案数据无法被加载。我们在 2020 年 3 月更改了相关格式，问题很可能仅此而已。给你带来不便，我们深表歉意！它只包含了你所选择的显示名称和默认玩家颜色。\n\n游戏现在会要求你重新填写这些内容，之后便可长期正常使用。",
  "Profile '{0}' had GameVersion '{1}' which is unknown. We are instead pretending it is the most recent '{2}'.": "档案 '{0}' 的 GameVersion 为 '{1}'，该版本未知。我们将其视为最新的 '{2}'。",
  "We got ": "",
  " campaign's data when deserializing": "",
  "Time Played": "游玩时长",
  "Campaign Games Played": "已进行战役数",
  "Campaign Games Won": "已获胜战役数",
  "Campaign Games Lost": "已失败战役数",
  "<color=#999999>Total </color>Ships Lost": "<color=#999999>总计 </color>损失单位",
  "<color=#999999>Total </color>Ships Killed": "<color=#999999>总计 </color>击毁单位",
  "NetworkTrafficLog.txt": "",
  "Networking Framework Not Availble": "网络框架不可用",
  "The networking framework '": "网络框架 '",
  "' is unfortunately not available on your system.  A new network framework will be located.\n\nThe reason for this issue is: ": "' 很遗憾在你的系统上不可用。我们将寻找一个新的网络框架。\n\n此问题的原因是：",
  "Cannot Play Multiplayer": "无法进行多人游戏",
  "Unfortunately, we could not find any available networking frameworks installed and working on your computer!": "很遗憾，我们未能在你的电脑上找到任何已安装且可用的网络框架！",
  "Networking Framework Changed": "网络框架已更改",
  "' is available and has been selected.": "' 可用，已被选择。",
  "' uses direct IP Address connections.  You will need the IP address of the host player you are planning to join.  They do not need yours, and you do not need to do any special configuration on your local machine (other than letting the game past your software firewall, if you have not already).": "' 使用直接 IP 地址连接。你需要提供你要加入的主机玩家的 IP 地址。他们不需要你的，而你也不需要在本机上进行任何特殊配置（除非你尚未允许游戏通过软件防火墙）。",
  "\nAdditionally, each player will need to be using the same port for the game, which can be any port.  The current port you are using is: ": "\n此外，每位玩家需要使用相同的游戏端口，该端口可以是任意端口。你当前使用的端口为：",
  "<color=#57a2f7>Make Sure You Have The IP Address And Port Of The Host!</color>\n": "<color=#57a2f7>请确保你拥有主机的 IP 地址和端口！</color>\n",
  "' uses direct IP Address connections.  You will need to provide one of your IP addresses to the other players who want to join a game with you.  For your convenience, the public and private IP addresses, and explanations regarding them, are all on the Networking tab of the settings menu.  You can also copy and paste the addresses from there to give to others.\n\nHere is a quick list of your addresses at the moment:": "' 使用直接 IP 地址连接。你需要向希望加入你游戏的其他玩家提供你的某个 IP 地址。为方便起见，公网和私网 IP 地址及其说明都位于设置菜单的网络标签页中。你也可以从那里复制并粘贴地址提供给他人。\n\n以下是你当前地址的快速列表：",
  "\nPublic IP: ": "\n公网 IP：",
  "Local IP: ": "本地 IP：",
  " (IPv6 - not preferred)\n": "（IPv6 - 不推荐使用）\n",
  "<color=#57a2f7>Make Sure Other Players Have Your IP Address!</color>\n": "<color=#57a2f7>请确保其他玩家拥有你的 IP 地址！</color>\n",
