  "ContentLoadWarning.GetWarningText.buffer": "",
  "The hosted game includes content you do not have installed and cannot be played:\n": "该托管游戏包含你未安装且无法运行的内容：\n",
  "This save game includes content you do not have installed and cannot be played:\n": "该存档游戏包含你未安装且无法运行的内容：\n",
  "The host is using a different combination of expansions and mods than you currently have enabled.\n\nTo continue, we will make the following changes:\n": "主机使用的扩展与模组组合与你当前启用的不同。\n\n要继续，我们将进行以下更改：\n",
  "This save was made using a different combination of expansions and mods than you currently have enabled.\n\nTo continue, we will make the following changes:\n": "该存档使用了与你当前启用的扩展与模组不同的组合。\n\n要继续，我们将进行以下更改：\n",
  "Other changes needed:\n": "其他所需更改：\n",
  "Cannot Load Savegame": "无法加载存档",
  "Cannot Connect To Host": "无法连接至主机",
  "Reload Data Files?": "重新加载数据文件？",
  "The host is using a different combination of expansions and mods than you currently have enabled. To continue, we will make the following changes:\n\n": "主机使用的扩展与模组组合与你当前启用的不同。要继续，我们将进行以下更改：\n\n",
  "Continue & Reload": "继续并重新加载",
  "Note that Settings > Expansions and Settings > Mods is where you can configure these yourself. All players must match the host's settings to connect.": "请注意，你可以在「设置 > 扩展包」和「设置 > 模组」中自行配置。所有玩家必须与主机设置一致才能连接。",
  "Continue With Load Of Savegame?": "是否继续加载存档？",
  "In some very limited cases, adding or removing a mod or expansion from an ongoing game may actually work. So we can try, but please don't report any errors on loading this savegame as bugs if you opt to continue; those are not actual bugs.": "在极少数情况下，为进行中的游戏添加或移除模组或扩展包可能确实可行。我们可以尝试，但如果你选择继续加载此存档，请不要将任何错误报告为 Bug，这些并非实际 Bug。",
  "Yes, Continue": "是，继续",
  " IsFromSelfWithoutNetwork: ": "",
  " senderNetworkID: ": "",
